1. Video: real generation wired to UI+API (MP4 preview/download), local vs real
   generation separated, GET /creation/video + POST /creation/video/generate.
2. Persistence: durable creation_jobs/events/artifacts tables + job-store.mjs
   write-through, restart hydration, interrupted->failed recovery.
3. Tests: real HTTP video-provider integration (MP4 ftyp sniff) + cost-gated live
   tests (VIDEO_LIVE_BUDGET_USD).
4. Providers: VIDEO_PROVIDER accepts google|replicate|http; AUDIO_PROVIDER adds
   replicate; truthful video.edit capability status.
5. Security: testable security-scan module (10 rules) + tenant isolation +
   sandbox hardening tests.
6. CI/CD: 25 deps pinned to exact versions, lockfile synced, CODEOWNERS,
   master branch-protection script + docs.
7. Docs: main README.md, PRODUCTION_READINESS Phase 4 addendum,
   docs/PHASE4_GAP_REMEDIATION.md, archive 30 reports, remove temp patches/logs.
8. Commercial: usage_quotas.monthly_cost_usd + usage_counters.cost_usd,
   consumeQuota enforces MONTHLY_COST_QUOTA_EXCEEDED (402) atomically, PLANS +
   usageSummary + chat call sites wired; cost + commercial-workflow tests.

Tests: npm test EXIT=0 (887 ok / 0 fail); backend 692 tests / 686 pass / 0 fail /
6 skipped; typecheck PASS; security:scan 0 findings; production-trial 9/9.
